a":437,"navigation":438,"path":12,"seo":439,"stem":13,"__hash__":440},"docs\u002F01.apps\u002F01.introduction.md",{"type":231,"value":232,"toc":426},"minimark",[233,237,242,245,249,276,280,361,367,373,379,383,386,419],[234,235,236],"p",{},"Kinotic is a next-generation cloud operating system that abstracts away infrastructure complexity so developers and AI agents can focus on what matters: building great applications.",[238,239,241],"h2",{"id":240},"humane-representation-of-thought","Humane Representation of Thought",[234,243,244],{},"The rise of AI-assisted development has unlocked a new paradigm -- rapid iteration driven by natural-language intent and intelligent code generation. Kinotic is purpose-built for this paradigm. Whether a human developer or an AI agent is writing the code, Kinotic provides the guardrails, services, and runtime that turn quick prototypes into production-grade systems.",[238,246,248],{"id":247},"core-components","Core Components",[250,251,252,259,264,270],"ul",{},[253,254,255,258],"li",{},[256,257,5],"strong",{}," -- Applications that run on Kinotic OS. Today, Kinotic Apps are built with TypeScript running on Bun -- you write standard TypeScript for domain models, business logic, and UI, and the platform handles infrastructure, deployment, and scaling. Support for Go, Java, and Python backends is coming soon.",[253,260,261,263],{},[256,262,143],{}," -- The cloud operating system that runs your apps. It provides authentication, authorization, persistence, service mesh, observability, and deployment infrastructure out of the box.",[253,265,266,269],{},[256,267,268],{},"Kinotic OS Cloud"," -- A fully managed SaaS offering of Kinotic OS. No servers to provision, no infrastructure to maintain.",[253,271,272,275],{},[256,273,274],{},"Kinotic CLI"," -- The developer tool that ties it all together. Use it to initialize projects, define entities, generate service code, and deploy applications.",[238,277,279],{"id":278},"why-kinotic","Why Kinotic?",[281,282,283,299],"table",{},[284,285,286],"thead",{},[287,288,289,293,296],"tr",{},[290,291,292],"th",{},"Concern",[290,294,295],{},"Without Kinotic",[290,297,298],{},"With Kinotic",[300,301,302,314,329,340,351],"tbody",{},[287,303,304,308,311],{},[305,306,307],"td",{},"Authentication & Authorization",[305,309,310],{},"Wire up OIDC and session management yourself",[305,312,313],{},"Built in -- configure once, enforce everywhere",[287,315,316,318,321],{},[305,317,59],{},[305,319,320],{},"Choose a database, write migrations, build CRUD endpoints",[305,322,323,324,328],{},"Define entities, run ",[325,326,327],"code",{},"kinotic sync",", get a full service layer",[287,330,331,334,337],{},[305,332,333],{},"Service Mesh",[305,335,336],{},"Deploy sidecars, configure routing, handle retries",[305,338,339],{},"Automatic service discovery and RPC across the application",[287,341,342,345,348],{},[305,343,344],{},"CI\u002FCD",[305,346,347],{},"Maintain pipelines, container registries, rollout strategies",[305,349,350],{},"Handled by the platform",[287,352,353,355,358],{},[305,354,181],{},[305,356,357],{},"Instrument code, deploy collectors, build dashboards",[305,359,360],{},"SBOM generation, metrics, and tracing are included",[234,362,363,366],{},[256,364,365],{},"Rapid prototyping."," Go from an idea to a running application in minutes with the CLI and generated services.",[234,368,369,372],{},[256,370,371],{},"Enterprise-ready."," Software bill of materials and full observability mean you never have to rewrite for production.",[234,374,375,378],{},[256,376,377],{},"Internet scale."," The platform is designed to scale horizontally from day one.",[238,380,382],{"id":381},"what-these-docs-cover","What These Docs Cover",[234,384,385],{},"This documentation walks through everything you need to build and ship a Kinotic App:",[387,388,389,394,399,404,409,414],"ol",{},[253,390,391,393],{},[256,392,15],{}," -- Scaffold a project and persist your first entity in under five minutes.",[253,395,396,398],{},[256,397,19],{}," -- Understand how organizations, applications, projects, and artifacts fit together.",[253,400,401,403],{},[256,402,38],{}," -- Publish and consume services across your application.",[253,405,406,408],{},[256,407,59],{}," -- Define entities, configure indexes, and run queries.",[253,410,411,413],{},[256,412,92],{}," -- Set up authentication and authorization.",[253,415,416,418],{},[256,417,103],{}," -- Ship your application to Kinotic OS or Kinotic OS Cloud.",[234,420,421,422,425],{},"Ready to build something? Head to the ",[423,424,15],"a",{"href":16}," to create your first Kinotic App.",{"title":427,"searchDepth":428,"depth":428,"links":429},"",2,[430,431,432,433],{"id":240,"depth":428,"text":241},{"id":247,"depth":428,"text":248},{"id":278,"depth":428,"text":279},{"id":381,"depth":428,"text":382},"Learn what Kinotic is, why it exists, and how it helps developers and AI agents build enterprise-grade applications at scale.","md",null,{},true,{"title":11,"description":434},"kWAFExdJBuvap6cvr7VlVEwd-U_8NHeOdkZ707K3NTM",[436,442],{"title":15,"path":16,"stem":17,"description":443,"children":-1},"Get started building your first Kinotic App -- from a provisioned project to a running CRUD service in under five minutes.",1790384331329]